  "scenario": "a10-builtin-scoping",
  "title": "One BUILTIN SID, three different groups",
  "description": "S-1-5-32-544 on FS10, S-1-5-32-544 on FS11, and S-1-5-32-544 as the domain's own BUILTIN group. Same SID, three groups, three memberships that have nothing to do with each other. Merging any two of them would invent access nobody has.",
  "expectations": {
